# Data — raw dataset tracked via Git LFS; processed and splits remain uncommitted
data/raw/*
data/processed/*
data/splits/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!data/splits/.gitkeep
!data/raw/Combined_dataset.csv

# Trained models
models/
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.pt
*.pth

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Optuna / experiment artefacts
*.db
optuna_study/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

